OL,3,GNEWSAPolice resources warning over
OL,4,Aasylum centre plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Police's temporary
OL,7,Fdeputy chief constable (DCC) said
OL,8,Fhandling anticipated protests at the
OL,9,Fsite would pull resources away from
OL,10,Felsewhere in the county, while a local
OL,11,Fcampaign group warned the "small, rural
OL,12,Fcommunity" would experience "city-sized
OL,13,Fproblems" if the plan went ahead.
OL,15,FThe Home Office said moving asylum
OL,16,Fseekers out of hotels to the likes of
OL,17,Fex-military sites represented a "fairer
OL,18,Fdistribution".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
